<title>UK: BSkyB sets autumn UK digital satellite start.</title>
<headline>BSkyB sets autumn UK digital satellite start.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BSkyB plans to launch 200-channel digital satellite television into the UK in autumn 1997, deputy managing director David Chance told Reuters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;That has been our plan for some time,&quot; Chance said when asked whether the final few months of this year remained the target date for the digital satellite launch.</p>
</text>
